{"id":"wb-7-1559","name":"水南关清真寺阿文碑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"水南关清真寺阿文碑","text":"水南关清真寺阿文碑是中华人民共和国河南省沁阳市水南关清真寺保存的一通元代阿拉伯文石碑。碑以青石制成，高180厘米、宽108厘米，刻有清真言及花卉边饰，其碑文是研究当地回族先民迁居及清真寺早期历史的材料。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E5%8D%97%E5%85%B3%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA%E9%98%BF%E6%96%87%E7%A2%91","revisionId":95427289,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427289","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1a9576e036f7bd6d49b341e6.jpg","title":"Qinyang_Shuinanguanqingzhensi_Awenbei_20190324.083315.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qinyang_Shuinanguanqingzhensi_Awenbei_20190324.083315.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/Qinyang_Shuinanguanqingzhensi_Awenbei_20190324.083315.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Acot一杯茶","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​水南关清真寺阿文碑局部。","width":320,"height":212}}